OL,3,GNEWSADay that changed our lives: The
OL,4,Ainside story of West Midlands wildfires
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn 13 August, wildfires swept across
OL,7,Fthe West Midlands, destroying 38 homes.
OL,8,FTwo months on, eyewitness accounts, 999
OL,9,Fcalls and harrowing footage reveal how
OL,10,Fthe day unfolded.
OL,12,FIt is 13:00 BST on the hottest day of
OL,13,Fthe year and five engines are speeding
OL,14,Ftowards a grass fire in Birmingham.
OL,16,FTemperatures are creeping towards 38C
OL,17,Fand it has been yet another busy
OL,18,Fmorning at West Midlands Fire Control.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
