OL,4,Ainside story of West Midlands wildfires
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut within minutes, the switchboard is
OL,7,Fjammed with panicked calls about
OL,8,Fwildfires in fields and parks that are
OL,9,Fmoving dangerously close to homes.
